<body>
<strong><div id="description">&nbsp; </div></strong>
<cfinclude template="programsearch_toc.cfm">
<HR COLOR="Orange">

<div align="center">


<p></p>
<table align="center" width="90%">
<tr><th colspan="2"><strong>Program Search</strong></th></tr>
<tr><td colspan="2">&nbsp;</td></tr>
<tr><td valign="top" colspan="2" align="center"><img src="../../images/program_search.gif"></td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="2">&nbsp; </td></tr>


<tr><td valign="top"> <img src="../../images/1.gif"></td><td>
To view the program scorecard from the search screen, click on [scorecard]. You can also create a new program by clicking on [create new].
</td></tr>
<tr><td valign="top" nowrap> <img src="../../images/2.gif"></td><td>
Hide Program Search/Show Program Search: You can hide or show the search criteria by clicking on this link. Hiding the search criteria allows more search results to be shown on one page. If you have not yet entered any search criteria when you click on this, all programs will be returned.
</td></tr>
<tr><td valign="top" nowrap> <img src="../../images/3.gif"></td><td>
You can search for programs using numerous criteria. You can enter the program title, the program number (generated by the <CFOUTPUT>#application.CompanyName#</CFOUTPUT>), program type and program status (Work in Progress, Request for Approval, Pre-Active, Active, Expiring, Expired). You can also enter program start and end dates, with dates after (<=), equal to (=), or before (>=) the dates you have entered. 
<p></p>
You may select the beneficiaries of the program by entering values in the <cfoutput>#application.returned_customer_setting.operator_label_singular#</cfoutput> Name, Broker or <cfoutput>#application.returned_customer_setting.distributor_label_singular#</cfoutput> Name fields. Since programs may have multiple beneficiaries, you may enter values in more than one of these and still return results. 
<p></p>
If you click on the [reset form] link the values you entered to search by will be cleared. Clicking on the [search program] link submits your search.
</td></tr>
<tr><td valign="top" nowrap> <img src="../../images/4.gif"></td><td>
Results of your search will appear below your search criteria.  You can sort search results by clicking on the blue titles. If you wish to reverse the order of the sort, click on the link again. An arrow will appear next to the current sort order showing which direction clicking on the link will sort the records.
<p></p>
Information about the returned programs is shown:<br>
<ul> 
<li><em>Colored Dot:</em> The color of the circle to the left indicates the status of the billback.
<Br>
<img src="../../images/program_status_guidw.gif">
</li>
<li><em>Program:</em> Displays the program number, clicking on it will bring you to that program.</li>
<li><em>Type:</em> The program type of the programs returned.</li>
<li><em>Title:</em> In addition to the Title, the reference number (assigned by the user) is displayed in parenthesis. Depending upon the status of the program, the approver of the program or the person requesting approval and the date they did so will also be shown.</li>
<li><em>Start/End:</em> The start and end dates for the program.</li>
<li><em>Quantity:</em> The program quantity.</li>
</ul>
</td></tr>

</table>
<p></p>
</div>

